# Every Darkmown feature

A paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, `code`, a [web link](https://markiedocs.com/docs?a=1) and a [mail link](mailto:hello@example.com?subject=Hi).

A [relative link](notes.md) and a [script link](javascript:alert(1)) are not kept.

![A picture](pic.png)

![A remote picture](https://example.com/remote.png)

> A quote.

---

:state count = 3
:state name = "Ada"
:state agree = false
:state size = "M"
:state tone = "warm"
:state items = [{"label": "Apples", "qty": 2}, {"label": "Pears", "qty": 5}, {"label": "Figs", "qty": 1}]
:slider level = 40 min=0 max=100 step=5
:computed doubled = count * 2
:computed greeting = "Hello, " + name
:computed total = sum(items, qty)

Count { count }, doubled { doubled }. { greeting }. Level { level | percent }. Total { total | number }.

:button "Add" -> count++
:button "Reset" -> count = 0

:bind name

:checkbox agree
- I agree

:select size
- S
- M
- L

:radio tone
- warm
- cool

:if agree
You agreed.
:else
You have not agreed.
:endif

@loop items into item sort by item.qty desc
- { item.label }: { item.qty }
@endloop

| Item | Qty |
| --- | --- |
| Count | { count } |
| Level | { level } |

:form into profile
:input name placeholder="Your name"
:input email type=email placeholder="Email"
:submit "Save"
:endform

Saved: { profile.name }.

